  "description": "A lightweight, MediatR-compatible mediator for .NET. Requests, notifications and pipeline behaviors resolved from Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection — a drop-in replacement for the MediatR surface most applications actually use. Targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0 with a single dependency.",
