  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes: a covariant Send (e.g. Send<object> or through IRequest<ISomeBase>) no longer poisons the handler cache; a behavior can hand next() a different cancellation token; AddOpenBehavior rejects behaviors without exactly two type parameters; a later AddSwitchboard call can add or replace the scope-per-dispatch callback. Fewer allocations per dispatch: none beyond the handler when no behaviors are registered. See CHANGELOG.md.",
